 AUM rose 15% YoY to Rs. 222 bn; PAT up 13% YoY at Rs. 4.74 bn.\nSpread improved 40 bps to 5.34%, NIM at 7.82%; stable asset quality with 1+ DPD at 3.8%.","url":"https://sqst.in/L2VaG","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-05T16:28:10","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"473250","title":"Aavas Financiers' Q3 net profit rose to 1.7B INR from 1.46B INR YoY.\nRevenue increased to 5.74B INR in Q3, up from 5.12B INR YoY.","summary":"Aavas Financiers' Q3 net profit rose to 1.7B INR from 1.46B INR YoY.\nRevenue increased to 5.74B INR in Q3, up from 5.12B INR YoY.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-05T16:26:50","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"807196260705222528","title":"AAVAS Financiers' board approved Q3 FY25 results: interest income INR 57,382 lakhs, PAT INR 17,005 lakhs.\nAFL Prime Lending Rate will be cut by 15 bps from March 1, 2026; NCDs have 100% security cover.","summary":"AAVAS Financiers' board approved Q3 FY25 results: interest income INR 57,382 lakhs, PAT INR 17,005 lakhs.\nAFL Prime Lending Rate will be cut by 15 bps from March 1, 2026; NCDs have 100% security cover.","url":"https://sqst.in/T4AbB","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-05T15:59:45","source":"ScoutQuest"},{"id":"442346","title":"AAVAS Financiers confirmed timely interest payment on NCDs Series A & B.\nInterest payment totaled Rs. 16.88 crore on Jan 16, 2026, per SEBI norms.","summary":"AAVAS Financiers confirmed timely interest payment on NCDs Series A & B.\nInterest payment totaled Rs. 16.88 crore on Jan 16, 2026, per SEBI norms.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=adcf8393-869d-4373-be6a-7c8b022fb93f.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-16T15:10:52","source":"BSE"},{"id":"441121","title":"Aavas Financiers Ltd informed about its statutory auditor's conversion to LLP.\nM S K A & Associates is now M S K A & Associates LLP; audit engagement remains unchanged.","summary":"Aavas Financiers Ltd informed about its statutory auditor's conversion to LLP.\nM S K A & Associates